invariant: INV-7
file: srv_flight.c
catches: srv_flight_test_aes
reason: a host object's server whose caller did not set
  CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_AES takes a second ClientHello whose cookie holds
  it to AES-128-GCM, which a server with the bit minted under the same
  cookie key. The session then keys AES-GCM traffic on instructions whose
  timing nobody stated. test_flight_without_aes requires that retry to
  fail with illegal_parameter without the bit and to open with it.

--- old
    if (!suite_runs_here(&h->t->cfg, suite)) {
--- new
    if (!suite_runs_here(&h->t->cfg, SUITE_CHACHA20_POLY1305_SHA256)) {
